---
import SubpageLayout from '../../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import contactData from '../../data/contact.json';
---

<SubpageLayout
  title="Contact Republic of Nauru — Questions & Site Feedback"
  description="Contact information for republicofnauru.com, including questions about visiting Nauru, travel planning, directory updates and site feedback."
  sectionEmoji="✉️"
  sectionLabel="Get in Touch"
 
  includeFooter={true}
>
  <p>Whether you're planning a visit, researching Nauru for academic purposes, or just curious about the world's smallest republic — we'd love to hear from you. Our team aims to respond to all inquiries within 2–3 business days.</p>

  <h2>Contact Information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>{contactData.address}</strong></li>
    <li><strong>{contactData.phone}</strong></li>
    <li><strong>{contactData.email}</strong></li>
    <li><strong>{contactData.hours}</strong></li>
  </ul>

  <div class="info-box">
    <h4>{contactData.emergency}</h4>
    <p>For police, fire, or medical emergencies while in Nauru, dial the appropriate emergency number above. For non-urgent medical matters, contact Nauru General Hospital on +674 557 3150.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Send Us a Message</h2>
  <p>Use the form below to send us a message, or email us directly at <a href="mailto:info@republicofnauru.com">info@republicofnauru.com</a>. Fields marked with * are required. We aim to respond within 2–3 business days.</p>

  <form class="contact-form" action="mailto:info@republicofnauru.com" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
    <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Name *" required />
    <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your Email *" required />
    <input type="text" name="subject" placeholder="Subject" />
    <textarea name="message" placeholder="Your Message *" required></textarea>
    <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">Send Message →</button>
  </form>
  <p class="form-note">Alternatively, send an email directly to <a href="mailto:info@republicofnauru.com">info@republicofnauru.com</a> — we read every message.</p>

  <h2>Visiting in Person?</h2>
    <p>The Government Information Office is located in the Government Complex in Yaren District. Walk-in visitors are welcome during business hours (Monday–Friday, 9:00 AM – 5:00 PM Nauru Time UTC+12). It's advisable to call ahead to schedule an appointment with the specific department you need.</p>

  <h2>Explore the site</h2>
  <div class="utility-grid">
    <a href="/visit/" class="utility-card"><h3>✈️ Plan a visit</h3><p>Travel guide for visas, transport, accommodation and more.</p></a>
    <a href="/directory/" class="utility-card"><h3>📞 Directory</h3><p>Key contacts and public services.</p></a>
    <a href="/services/" class="utility-card"><h3>🛠️ Services hub</h3><p>Citizenship, immigration, health and education.</p></a>
    <a href="/news/" class="utility-card"><h3>📰 News & updates</h3><p>Current announcements and policy changes.</p></a>
  </div>
</SubpageLayout>

<style>
  .contact-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  .contact-form input,
  .contact-form textarea {
    border: 2px solid #1a1a2e;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color .25s;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .contact-form input:focus,
  .contact-form textarea:focus {
    border-color: #FFC72C;
  }
  .contact-form textarea {
    min-height: 120px;
    resize: vertical;
  }
  .submit-btn {
    background: #002B7F;
    color: #FFC72C;
    border: none;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    cursor: pointer;
    clip-path: polygon(8px 0%,100% 0%,calc(100% - 8px) 100%,0% 100%);
    transition: all .25s;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }
  .submit-btn:hover {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
  .form-note {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #64748b;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
</style>
